<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Warning - Group Policy Preferences debug logging may be enabled - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This fixlet is relevant if tracing is enabled for one or more Group Policy Preferences Extensions.</P>
<P>Tracing creates detailed log files on the system and may reduce performance of the Group Policy client. This could impact start-up and login time.</P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists keys whose (value &quot;LogLevel&quot; of it as string != &quot;0&quot;) of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\Group Policy&quot; of native registry</Relevance>
    <Category>Group Policy</Category>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-04-23</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:19:04 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
